."}),e.jsx("li",{children:"In the actual test the number of questions and time limit of each test will vary."}),e.jsx("li",{children:"There are a total of five tests in this Aptitude test battery."}),e.jsx("li",{children:"Before the start of every test, a screen will appear which will have the test specific instructions explaining the way to solve the test, number of questions and also the time limit. Apart from this, you will be shown examples with solution enabling you to have a better understanding of the test for attempting the test questions."}),e.jsx("li",{children:"After completion of allotted time, the instructions screen will be replaced by the main test screen to start the test."}),e.jsxs("li",{children:["Except for Memory Test, if you wish to go through the instructions of the test again then click on icon"," ",e.jsx("img",{src:"/images/icon/group-instruction.png"})," situated at the top right corner of your screen. This icon contains instructions for the respective test."]}),e.jsxs("li",{children:["If you want to see again the instructions of Memory test then click on button ",e.jsx("img",{src:"/images/icon/memory-1.png"})," situated at the upper left corner of the screen. To go back to the test screen please click again on the same part of Test screen."]}),e.jsx("li",{children:"You are advised to understand the instructions carefully beforehand with the help of Memory Test examples to save your time."}),e.jsxs("li",{children:["In case you need to go through general instruction you can click on the icon given ",e.jsx("img",{src:"/images/icon/instruction.png"})," at top right hand corner."]}),e.jsx("li",{children:"After the completion of every test a rest period of 01 minute will be provided to you to be prepared for the next test."}),e.jsx("li",{children:"In the main test you have the facility to scroll down or across for better view of the test questions."}),e.jsx("li",{children:"Instruction screen, practise screen (in case of Memory test) and the main 