            <li>Maximum 4 questions will be visible on Questions Page at a time.</li> 
            <li>Both Up – Down and Left – Right scroll bars will appear on Questions Page.</li> 
            <li>Only 1 option will be visible, all others will be hidden on the right side.</li> 
          </ul>  `},{Id:"67778a2c1b603fa444cedf23",name:"Building Memory",value:`  <ul>
    <li>
