    <li>Maximum 2 questions will be visible at a time.</li>
    <li>Only 1 option will be visible.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
          
        `}]},{id:5,heading:"View 4",image:"",category:[{Id:"67779834130eb716b407fe92",name:"Track Memory",value:`<ul>
